docs {
  # Admin DataShare Summary

  Returns high-level MTN datashare stock and profit totals.

  Use this endpoint for dashboard cards at the top of the datashare inventory
  screen.

  ## Endpoint

  ```txt
  GET /api/v1/admin/services/data/datashare/summary
  ```

  ## Success Response

  ```json
  {
    "summary": {
      "network": "MTN",
      "activeSimCount": 3,
      "totalMb": 15360,
      "total": "15GB",
      "remainingMb": 10240,
      "remaining": "10GB",
      "soldMb": 5120,
      "sold": "5GB",
      "totalCost": 3000,
      "revenue": 4200,
      "costSpent": 1000,
      "profit": 3200,
      "unmatchedCount": 0,
      "usageByStatus": {
        "matched": {
          "count": 5,
          "soldMb": 5120,
          "sold": "5GB"
        }
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Frontend Notes

  Highlight `unmatchedCount` when it is greater than zero. An unmatched usage
  means data was delivered but the backend could not match the sender SIM to an
  active stock batch.
}
